        "rationale": "The agent correctly identified the oldest open corrective work order (1000052, CM, priority 3, FC006, no technician) and correctly excluded 1000051 as a PdM (non-corrective) order. It retrieved the correct sensor history for the window and identified all four samples as complete. The DGA classification (T2 thermal on both first and last samples, class unchanged) is consistent with the data, even though it fell back to manual IEC 60599 ratios after fmsr.interpret_dga reportedly failed. However, t",
